  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_560350.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fall-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/all-the-compatibility?logo=modrinth&amp;label=&amp;suffix= &amp;style=flat&amp;color=242629&amp;labelColor=5ca424&amp;logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/560350(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📖 介紹</h2><p>此模組旨在讓 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheOres</a> 與所有科技模組的機器相容，為所有可用的礦物添加缺失的配方，並確保儘可能使用 AllTheOres 中的礦物/錠/粉/…！</p><p>不再有 5 種不同的錫錠或缺失的配方！</p><h3>新增超過 3,000 種配方！</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📷 展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/review_1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"review_pic_1\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/review_2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"review_pic_2\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🗃️ 依賴項</h2><h3>必須安裝：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All the Ores</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>高爐、熔爐、鍛造台、粉塵轉換配方、礦塊轉換配方</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>支援的模組：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/assemblylinemachines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Assembly Line Machines</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研磨機、合金熔煉爐、流體浴、流體混合機、金屬成型機、氣動沖壓機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎輪、攪拌機、沖壓機、合成器、批量爆破、批量清洗、注液器</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voluminous-energy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Voluminous Energy</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎機、離心分離機、內爆壓縮機、工業高爐</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Reborn</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎機、壓縮機、合金熔煉爐、錘子、掃描儀、軋鋼機、廢料箱、礦石清洗機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Industrial Contraptions</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎機、擠出機、離心機、軋鋼機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/energized-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Energized Power</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎機、合金爐、壓縮機、金屬沖壓機、過濾裝置、晶體生長室、流體轉運器</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-industrialization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Industrialization</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>組裝機、離心機、混合機、壓縮機、切割機、鍛造錘、粉碎機、打包機、解包機、內爆壓縮機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oritech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OriTech</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>原子鍛造爐、離心機、鑄造廠、深層鑽機、碎片鍛造爐、粉碎機、粒子加速器</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>壓縮機、合金熔煉爐、錘子</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>轉化</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>礦石花、伊格尼姆礦石花、魔力灌注</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyclic</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>粉碎機、熔煉機、固化機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plain-grinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plain Grinder</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研磨機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-grinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Grinder</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>研磨機</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replication\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Replication</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>物質值</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>為所有機器提供的金屬支援</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>裝瓶機，由 ATO 添加：[合金熔煉爐、電弧爐、粉碎機、金屬沖壓機]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>由 ATO 添加：[粉碎機、化學結晶器、化學清洗機、注射室、淨化室、富集室、化學轉化]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender IO</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>由 ATO 添加：[合金熔煉爐、磨砂機]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/actually-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actually Additions</a></strong>\n<ul>\n<li>由 ATO 添加：[粉碎機]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><hr><p>安裝 ATO 後，應在設定中關閉已包含在 ATO 中的其他模組的所有礦物。</p><p><strong>免責聲明：</strong>我和此模組並非 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/atmteam/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ATM-team</a> 的直接成員</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🎮 我的其他模組！</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"額外結構\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"基岩礦工\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"工具升級\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"All The Compatibility\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"自訂地城戰利品\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"