f=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"辭典\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Nexus\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"方塊偵探\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑花盆\" width=\"85\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><p><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"message\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"70\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fxxrexraptorxx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/kofi_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"70\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=75131568\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/patreon_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"70\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><i